---Sets the flight computer's target attitude as a quaternion; the flight computer turns its control frame (the command part's axes) to match it. While the engines are thrusting (or an automatic burn is armed) that control frame is thrust-aligned instead, with +X along the net thrust. Waits for the solver slot.
---Action: `vessel.attitude_target` (Solver)
---@async
---@param q ksa.Quat The target orientation.
---@return ksa.CommandResult
function VesselRef:set_attitude_target(q) end

---Enables or disables RCS in the flight computer. Waits for the solver slot.
---Action: `vessel.rcs_mode` (Solver)
---@async
---@param m "Enabled"|"Disabled" `"Enabled"` or `"Disabled"`.
---@return ksa.CommandResult
function VesselRef:set_rcs_mode(m) end

---Plans an automatic burn of the given delta-v at the given time. Waits for the solver slot.
---Action: `vessel.burn` (Solver)
---@async
---@param ut number Universal time at which the burn starts, in seconds.
---@param dv ksa.Vec3 Delta-v vector in the parent body's CCI frame, in m/s.
---@return ksa.CommandResult
function VesselRef:burn(ut, dv) end

