---@field resource string The resource name (for example a propellant).
---@field amount number The current amount of the resource.
---@field capacity number The tank capacity.
---@field fraction number The fill fraction, 0 to 1.

---One RCS thruster controller's state. Read-only data reflected from the game's RcsSnapshot record.
