---@field index number The module's index on the vessel (its ordinal for actions).
---@field produced_w number Instantaneous power produced, in watts.
---@field occluded boolean Whether the panel is shadowed.
---@field sun_aoa_deg number The sun's angle of attack on the panel, in degrees.
