---@field substance string Substance (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field grain string Grain (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field grain_shape string Grain shape (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field stack_valid boolean Stack valid (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field stack_error string Stack error (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field propellant_available boolean Propellant available (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field mass_unburnable_kg number Mass unburnable, in kilograms (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field mass_burnable_kg number Mass burnable, in kilograms (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
