---@field exit_pressure_pa number Exit pressure, in pascals (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field exit_temperature_k number Exit temperature, in kelvin (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field burning_area_m2 number Burning area, in m^2 (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
---@field area_ratio number Area ratio (from the game's SrbSnapshot).
