---@field mass_initial_kg number Mass initial, in kilograms (from the game's SrbSegmentSnapshot).
---@field part_instance_id number Part instance id (from the game's SrbSegmentSnapshot).
---@field substance string Substance (from the game's SrbSegmentSnapshot).
---@field grain string Grain (from the game's SrbSegmentSnapshot).
---@field mass_unburnable_kg number Mass unburnable, in kilograms (from the game's SrbSegmentSnapshot).
