---@class ksa.Attitude
---@field quat ksa.Quat Body-to-CCI rotation.
---@field rates ksa.Vec3 Angular rates about the body axes, in rad/s.

---A vessel's altitude, in metres.
---@class ksa.Altitude
---@field barometric number Altitude above the reference surface used for pressure.
---@field radar number Height above the terrain below.

---A vessel's mass properties.
---@class ksa.Mass
---@field total number Total mass, in kilograms.
---@field dry number Mass without propellant, in kilograms.
---@field propellant number Propellant mass, in kilograms.
---@field center_of_mass ksa.Vec3 Centre of mass in the vessel frame, in metres.

---A vessel's electrical power balance.
---@class ksa.Power
